        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Duffell, Fred Niblo, James Mason, Robert Culp, Telly Savalas\n- Works: Inside Out\n- Roles: film director, television director, screenwriter, film actor, producer\n- Places: Canterbury, England\n- Topics: British film, American film\n\nFacts:\n- Fred Niblo was born on January 6, 1874, and he became an American pioneer film actor, director, and producer.\n- Peter Duffell was born in 1937 in Canterbury, England, and he became a British film and television director and screenwriter.\n- Fred Niblo died on November 11, 1948.\n- Inside Out is a 1975 British action thriller film.\n- Peter Duffell produced and directed Inside Out.\n- Inside Out stars James Mason, Robert Culp, and Telly Savalas.",
